*.token
secrets.properties

# Signing material never enters the repository
*.jks
*.keystore

# Unsanitised copies of the partner API contract (hosts, Swagger, real device ids) stay local
docs/private/

# Screenshot goldens (ADR-024). Ignored *for now*, and the reason matters: font rasterisation differs
# between operating systems, so an image recorded on a developer machine differs from the CI Linux
# runner's in every anti-aliased pixel. Committing one from here would make every later comparison
# fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the UI.
#
# The baseline is meant to be committed — from a run of the `verify` job, whose `screenshots`
# artifact carries it. When that lands, delete these two lines and the set becomes a real regression
# gate instead of pictures attached to a PR.
shared/app/src/androidHostTest/goldens/
